<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>构图图例库 · 从关系到画法</title>
<style>
:root{--ink:#1c3941;--muted:#63777c;--paper:#f6f5f0;--line:#dce2dc;--green:#186d5c;--soft:#e8eee8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.65 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}button,a{touch-action:manipulation}button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}a{color:var(--green);text-underline-offset:3px}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c27338;outline-offset:3px}[hidden]{display:none!important}
header{padding:30px 4vw 0;background:#19383f;color:#fff;border-top:4px solid #c17149}.headerline{max-width:1740px;margin:auto;display:flex;gap:32px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#b9cdca}h1{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,39px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1.25;margin:8px 0 12px}.intro{color:#d6e2dd;max-width:750px;margin:0}.stats{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}.stat b{display:block;font-size:26px;font-weight:500}.stat span{font-size:11px;color:#c2d3cd}.topnav{max-width:1740px;margin:25px auto 0;display:flex;gap:7px;overflow:auto}.navbtn{border:0;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;background:transparent;color:#bed1cc;white-space:nowrap;padding:12px 19px}.navbtn.active{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.navbtn:hover{background:#ffffff14}.navbtn.active:hover{background:var(--paper)}
.shell{max-width:1840px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:225px minmax(0,1fr);gap:30px;padding:28px 4vw 70px}.sidebar{position:sticky;top:18px;align-self:start;max-height:calc(100vh - 36px);overflow:auto;padding-right:3px}.sidebar summary{font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding-bottom:10px}.filter-label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin:13px 0 4px}input[type=search],select{width:100%;border:1px solid #bdcbc5;background:#fff;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:5px;font-size:13px}.subnote{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:9px 0}.sidegroup{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:15px;padding-top:5px}.side-links a{display:block;margin:8px 0;font-size:12px}.primary,.secondary,.pill{border-radius:5px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid #bdcbc5;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-size:12px}.primary{background:var(--green);color:white;border-color:var(--green)}.secondary:hover,.pill:hover{background:var(--soft)}.wide{width:100%;margin-top:9px}.section-title{font-size:23px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.5px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px}.section-intro{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px;max-width:950px}.explorer{margin-bottom:30px}.chooser{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.choice{text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:14px;min-height:135px}.choice:hover{border-color:#448774;background:#fcfdfa}.choice.active{border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--green);background:#edf4ed}.choice strong{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.choice .question{font-size:12px;color:#62787a;line-height:1.6;display:block;margin:5px 0 10px}.choice small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#8a6652}.skeleton{width:100%;height:60px;color:#28715f;display:block;margin-bottom:9px}.aside-note{padding:13px 16px;border-left:3px solid #b57048;background:#f0ede3;font-size:12px;color:#596b6d;margin-top:15px}
.tour-tabs{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:19px}.pill.active{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:white}.tour-head{background:#e8eee6;border:1px solid #d5e1d7;padding:20px 23px;border-radius:7px;margin-bottom:17px}.tour-head h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.5}.tour-head p{margin:8px 0;color:#4c686b}.tour-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.tour-card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.tour-card .body{padding:16px 18px}.tour-card h4{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600}.tour-card p{font-size:13px;color:#60767a;margin:6px 0}.tour-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:13px}.pill{border-radius:20px;padding:6px 12px}.result-line{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0 17px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.result-line select{width:auto;padding:6px 9px;margin-left:6px}.active-filters{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;margin:0 0 14px}.filterchip{background:#e6ede5;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 9px}.result-guide{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.thumb{border:0;display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;background:#fff;padding:13px;position:relative}.thumb:hover{background:#fafcf7}.thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.kind{position:absolute;right:7px;bottom:6px;background:#fffffff0;border:1px solid #dce2dc;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;font-size:10px;color:#62787a}.cardbody{padding:14px 17px;flex:1}.cardmeta{font-size:11px;color:#8a6652;letter-spacing:.3px;margin-bottom:7px}.card h2{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 9px}.titlebutton{border:0;padding:0;text-align:left;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:inherit}.recipe{font-size:12px;color:#4c696d;line-height:1.75;margin:8px 0}.tags{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:9px}.tag{font-size:10px;color:#476c63;background:#eff4ef;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px}.tag.layout{background:#f4f0e6;color:#806649}.local-open{font-size:12px;margin-top:12px}.cardfoot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid #edf0eb;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11px}.access{color:#667c7d;max-width:60%}.actions{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}.iconbtn{border:0;background:transparent;font-size:20px;line-height:1;padding:0 4px;color:#6d8382}.iconbtn.on{color:#ad582f}.comparecheck{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;cursor:pointer}.empty{padding:45px 20px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed #b9c9bd;border-radius:6px;color:#637a7b}
.about{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:35px;padding-top:18px;color:#5d7375;font-size:12px}.about summary{font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.about h3{color:var(--ink);font-size:14px}.about li{margin:6px 0}.comparebar{position:fixed;bottom:16px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#193b40;color:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:12px 17px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;z-index:8;box-shadow:0 4px 20px #18393d33}.comparebar .secondary{background:transparent;color:#fff}.modal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;overflow:auto;background:#0e292fc9;padding:25px;z-index:20}.modal.open{display:block}.dialog{max-width:1390px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:28px;position:relative}.dialog h2{font-size:25px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;margin:12px 38px 18px 0}.close{position:absolute;right:16px;top:10px;border:0;background:white;font-size:28px;color:#4c686d}.detail-nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;padding-right:30px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.detail-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.5fr) minmax(280px,1fr);gap:27px}.large-img{width:100%;max-height:650px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafcf8}.detailtext dt,.compare-item dt{font-weight:600;font-size:12px;margin-top:15px}.detailtext dd,.compare-item dd{margin:4px 0;color:#526e71;font-size:13px}.recipe-box{background:#eef3eb;padding:13px 16px;margin:10px 0;border-left:3px solid #44836b}.recipe-box b{display:block;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px}.detailsource{font-size:11px;color:#6c8181;margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.detaillinks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:13px;margin:15px 0;font-size:13px}.compare-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.compare-item h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}.compare-item img{width:100%;height:260px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid var(--line)}.related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px;margin-top:12px}.related-card{text-align:left;background:#fafcf8;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:12px}.related-card img{width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:contain}.related-card strong{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-top:8px}.related-card small{color:#6a7c79;font-size:11px}.status{position:fixed;top:18px;right:18px;background:#2e5e56;color:white;padding:11px 17px;border-radius:5px;z-index:30}.noimage{padding:35px 10px;background:#f0f4ee}.footerlinks{font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted);margin-top:25px}.footerlinks a{margin-right:12px}
@media(min-width:1600px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:1200px){.chooser{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.headerline{align-items:flex-start}.stats{min-width:210px;gap:15px}.stat b{font-size:22px}.detail-top{grid-template-columns:1fr}.shell{grid-template-columns:205px minmax(0,1fr);gap:23px}.tour-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tour-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.tour-card .thumb{height:100%;min-height:200px}.compare-item img{height:210px}}
@media(max-width:760px){header{padding:22px 20px 0}.headerline{display:block}.stats{margin-top:18px;gap:23px}.stat b{display:inline;font-size:21px;margin-right:4px}.navbtn{padding:10px 13px;font-size:12px}.shell{display:block;padding:20px}.sidebar{position:static;max-height:none;margin-bottom:22px}.sidebar>details{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;background:#eef1e9;border-radius:5px}.filter-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 12px}.filter-controls>div:first-child,.sidebar .sidegroup{grid-column:1/-1}.side-links{display:none}.chooser{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.choice{min-height:120px;padding:12px}.grid,.tour-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tour-card{display:block}.tour-card .thumb{min-height:0}.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}.section-title{font-size:21px}.modal{padding:10px}.dialog{padding:20px 16px}.dialog h2{font-size:21px}.compare-grid,.related-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.related-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;column-gap:12px}.related-card img{height:85px;grid-row:1/3}.comparebar{width:calc(100% - 22px);justify-content:space-between;gap:7px}.result-line select{max-width:180px}}
@media print{.sidebar,.topnav,.toolbar,.comparebar,.actions,#explorer,.active-filters{display:none}header{background:white;color:black}.intro{color:#444}.shell{display:block}.card{break-inside:avoid}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
</style></head><body>
<noscript><p style="padding:18px;background:#fff1d2">当前预览器不执行脚本。请打开 <a href="静态总览.html">静态总览</a> 或 <a href="分类地图.html">分类地图</a>。</p></noscript>
<div id="loadingNotice" style="padding:13px 4vw;background:#fff1d2">正在载入本地图库。如果列表未出现，可以直接打开 <a href="静态总览.html">无脚本静态总览</a>。</div>
<header><div class="headerline"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMPOSITION STUDY LIBRARY · 分类重审版</div><h1>先想清关系，再拓宽画法。</h1><p class="intro">从“我想说清什么”找图，从不同空间骨架获得新想法。保留原图、来源与本地文件，把复合图拆成可以学习的组织方式。</p></div><div class="stats" id="stats"></div></div>
<nav class="topnav" id="views" aria-label="浏览路径"><button class="navbtn active" data-view="purpose">① 按表达目的</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="layout">② 按空间骨架</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="tours">③ 同题换画法</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="compound">复合图拆解</button><button class="navbtn" data-view="browse">全部素材</button></nav></header>
<div class="shell"><aside class="sidebar"><details open><summary>筛选与检索</summary><div class="filter-controls">
<div><label class="filter-label" for="search">关键词 / 图例编号</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="如：共享、客户、K002"></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="task">想说清什么</label><select id="task"></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="layout">空间骨架</label><select id="layout"></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="context">应用领域</label><select id="context"></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="role">材料角色</label><select id="role"><option value="diagrams">图例与画布 · 隐藏套装</option><option value="all">全部角色 · 含套装</option><option value="single">单一关系图</option><option value="composite">复合关系图</option><option value="worksheet">工作画布</option><option value="pack">套装与资源包</option></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="access">本地文件</label><select id="access"><option value="all">全部格式</option><option value="editable">有可编辑文件</option><option value="ppt">有 PowerPoint 文件</option><option value="saved">有本地原文件</option><option value="reference">静态参考 / 无可编辑文件</option></select></div>
<div><label class="filter-label" for="batch">收录批次</label><select id="batch"></select></div>
<div id="publicationFilter" hidden><label class="filter-label" for="visibility">公开浏览范围</label><select id="visibility"><option value="allowed">本站有原图的素材</option><option value="all">全部来源 · 含仅链接条目</option></select></div>
<div class="sidegroup"><button class="secondary wide" id="reset">清空筛选 · 重新找图</button><button class="secondary wide" id="exportFav">导出我的收藏</button><p class="subnote">目的与骨架可交叉筛选。复合图有多个标签，分类计数不能相加当作素材总量。</p></div>
</div></details><div class="side-links"><a href="分类地图.html">查看完整分类地图</a><a href="静态总览.html">无脚本静态总览</a><a href="分类下载索引.html">打开本地原文件</a></div></aside>
<main><section id="explorer" class="explorer" aria-label="构图探索"></section>
<section id="catalog" aria-label="图例列表"><div class="toolbar" id="modes"><button class="pill active" data-mode="all">当前范围全部</button><button class="pill" data-mode="new">本轮新增</button><button class="pill" data-mode="featured">精选起步</button><button class="pill" data-mode="favorites">我的收藏</button><button class="pill" id="showPacks">单独看套装</button></div>
<div class="active-filters" id="activeFilters"></div><p class="result-guide" id="resultGuide"></p>
<div class="result-line"><span id="resultCount" aria-live="polite"></span><label for="sort">浏览顺序<select id="sort"><option value="diverse">轮换骨架 · 拓宽视野</option><option value="recommended">精选优先</option><option value="id">按编号</option></select></label></div>
<div class="grid" id="grid"></div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><p>当前条件没有交集。可以去掉一个骨架、领域或文件条件。</p><button class="secondary" id="emptyReset">清空筛选</button></div></section>
<details class="about" id="classificationAbout"><summary>为什么重新分类？怎样避免分类反过来限制想象？</summary><div class="about-grid"><div><h3>把不同问题拆开问</h3><ol><li><b>表达关系：</b>图要让读者理解什么？一张图可以有多个关系。</li><li><b>空间骨架：</b>信息放在哪里？同一关系可以有多种画法。</li><li><b>应用领域：</b>架构、业务、理论是素材语境，不再与矩阵、循环混为同级类别。</li><li><b>材料角色：</b>单图、复合图、画布、套装分别浏览，避免用封面推断全部内容。</li></ol></div><div><h3>四个容易误读的地方</h3><ul><li>环形排布不一定表示循环，螺旋也可能只是阶段顺序。</li><li>中心加外围不一定是网络，也可能是分类或两层分解。</li><li>金字塔不一定表示数量，逐层高度也不自动代表成熟度。</li><li>矩阵是位置骨架；其中可以表达对应、责任、阶段或判断。</li></ul><p>这是本库的学习检索口径。分类依据当前所展示的预览；对套装的判断不外推到未查看页面。</p></div></div><div id="reviewSummary"></div><p><a href="分类重审说明.txt">查看重审说明与明确纠正记录</a></p></details>
<div class="footerlinks" id="footnote"></div></main></div>
<div class="comparebar" id="comparebar" hidden><span id="comparecount"></span><button class="primary" id="compareBtn">并排对照</button><button class="secondary" id="clearCompare">清空</button></div>
<div class="modal" id="modal"><section class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="dialogtitle"><button class="close" id="closeModal" aria-label="关闭详情">×</button><div id="dialogContent"></div></section></div><div class="status" id="toast" role="status" hidden></div>
<script id="library-data" type="application/json">__DATA__</script><script>
__MODEL_JS__
__APP_JS__
</script></body></html>
